---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Retirement Income Planning Nashville, TN | Independent Advisor"
  description="Retirement income planning for Nashville families — guaranteed income strategies, Social Security timing, and making sure your money lasts as long as you do."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-navy-300 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-gold-400">Retirement Income Planning</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">Retirement Income Planning</h1>
      <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Retirement isn't just about how much you've saved — it's about turning what you've built into income you can't outlive. We help Nashville families build a plan that pays reliably, no matter how long retirement lasts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">

        <!-- Primary Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">
            Guaranteed Income Planning for Nashville Families
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Saving for retirement is only half the problem. The other half is making sure that money lasts as long as you do — and pays reliably whether markets are up, down, or sideways. Most people reach retirement without a clear answer to the question: where does the monthly income come from?</p>
            <p>We work with Nashville families to build a retirement income plan before they need it. That means identifying the right mix of guaranteed income sources, Social Security timing, and strategies that protect principal while still generating predictable cash flow. If you're within 10 years of retirement and uncertain about what happens when the paycheck stops, that's the conversation to have now — while there are still good options on the table.</p>
            <p>As an independent advisor we're not tied to any single carrier's products. We can look across multiple providers to find the structure that fits your retirement picture — without a commission agenda driving the recommendation.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Strategy Types -->
          <div class="mt-12">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Retirement Income Strategies We Review</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              {[
                { name: 'Guaranteed Fixed Income', desc: 'A predictable income stream that pays reliably for life — principal-protected and immune to market swings. The foundation of a retirement income plan for many Nashville families.' },
                { name: 'Indexed Growth Strategies', desc: 'Growth tied to a market index with a floor that protects your principal from downside. More upside potential than fixed strategies while preserving the income guarantee.' },
                { name: 'Social Security Timing', desc: 'When you claim Social Security dramatically affects lifetime income. We model the breakeven math and help you decide when to claim based on your health, other income sources, and retirement timeline.' },
                { name: 'Income Gap Analysis', desc: "We map your fixed expenses against your guaranteed income sources and identify the gap that needs to be funded — so you know exactly what your retirement income plan needs to cover." },
              ].map((strategy) => (
                <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
                  <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-1">{strategy.name}</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">{strategy.desc}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Retirement Income Section -->
          <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-navy-900 text-white">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">
              Planning for Nashville Families in or Near Retirement
            </h3>
            <p class="text-navy-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              For most Nashville families, retirement income comes from a combination of Social Security, savings, and — if they planned ahead — guaranteed income sources that pay no matter what markets do. The question isn't just how much you've saved. It's how long it needs to last, what your fixed expenses look like, and what happens if one spouse dies first. We work through that picture with you so retirement feels like a plan, not a guess.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-900 text-white">
              <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Plan Your Retirement Income</h3>
              <p class="text-navy-200 text-sm mb-5">
                Not sure where your monthly income comes from in retirement? Let's work through it.
              </p>
              <a
                href="/contact"
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-900 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Book a Coverage Check
              </a>
              <a
                href={`tel:${BRAND.phoneE164}`}
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 mt-3 border border-navy-600 hover:border-navy-400 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Call {BRAND.phone}
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">Related Services</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li><a href="/services/life-insurance" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Life Insurance →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/long-term-care" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Long-Term Care →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/medicare" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Medicare Planning →</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
